# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic. greys_network.html is generated with newline="\n" and
# the test suites match on "<script>\n(const DATA". If git checked the file out
# with CRLF on Windows, all three suites would fail on a fresh clone -- which is
# exactly the state this project was handed over in.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
